{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1860","published":"2026-04-11T11:10:52Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:47.036569309Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-5037"],"summary":"mxml security update","details":"Mini-XML is a small XML parsing library that you can use to read XML and XML-like data files in your application without requiring large non-standard libraries.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA vulnerability was determined in mxml up to 4.0.4. This issue affects the function index_sort of the file mxml-index.c of the component mxmlIndexNew. Executing a manipulation of the argument tempr can lead to stack-based buffer overflow. The attack is restricted to local execution. The exploit has been publicly disclosed and may be utilized. This patch is called 6e27354466092a1ac65601e01ce6708710bb9fa5. A patch should be applied to remediate this issue.(CVE-2026-5037)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"mxml","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/mxml&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["mxml-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","mxml-debuginfo-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","mxml-debugsource-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","mxml-devel-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"src":["mxml-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["mxml-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","mxml-debuginfo-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","mxml-debugsource-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","mxml-devel-3.3.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1860.json"}},{"package":{"name":"mxml","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/mxml&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.2-2.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["mxml-3.2-2.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","mxml-debuginfo-3.2-2.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","mxml-debugsource-3.2-2.oe2003sp4.aarch